$ /usr/bin/python3 probes/gather_floor.py
# cwd .

Gathering 64 elements out of a source of growing size.
If cost tracks source size, the gather has an O(source) floor.

      source   src MB        us   GB/s over src  reduces
      65,536      0.3      57.1             4.6        1
     262,144      1.0      59.6            17.6        1
   1,048,576      4.2      61.6            68.1        1
   1,328,176      5.3      55.8            95.2        1
   4,194,304     16.8      70.1           239.4        1
  16,777,216     67.1     315.1           213.0        2

For contrast, many elements from a small source (the case a
compiler is designed for):

      source        out        us  reduces
      16,384      4,096      36.4        0
      16,384     65,536      36.9        0
      16,384  1,048,576      96.5        0

